  "answer_reference_text": "R-CNN used external Selective Search proposals fed into a CNN per region. Fast R-CNN moved feature extraction to a single shared forward pass and applied RoI pooling, but still relied on external proposals. Faster R-CNN replaced external proposals with an integrated Region Proposal Network (RPN) that shares features with the detection head, making proposals nearly cost-free.",
